<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MARRAKESH AND COTTON SPORTS DRAW 1-1 IN AFRICAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MARRAKESH AND COTTON SPORTS DRAW 1-1 IN AFRICAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marrakesh of Morocco drew 1-1 (halftime 1-1) with Cotton Sports Garoua of Cameroon in an African Confederation Football Cup second round first leg match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Marrakesh - Youssef Mariana 18</p>
<p>Cotton Sports - Ngom Nomi 35</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,500</p>
